description	"Obi-Wan Kenobi 

A Jedi who has mastered the art of defensive fighting.

^2Weaponry:
- Melee
-- 10% faster RoF
- Lightsaber (Yellow/Blue)
-- Saber/Blaster Defense (3)
--- BP Regen: 5/.4s
-- Blaster Deflect (3)
-- Disarms on hit
-- 8% more Fast style damage
-- 25% more special damage
-- Saber Throw ^3[CS1]
--- 33% more damage
 
^5Force Powers:
- Jump (3)
- Push (3)
- Pull (1)
- Sense (3)
- Speed (1)

^8Attributes:
- Blast Armor
- Healing (1)
- Force Block (1)
- Force Focus (2)

A dedicated and legendary Jedi Knight, Obi-Wan Kenobi has had a long and tumultuous career that has helped shape the fate of an entire galaxy. When he was 25 standard years old, he was caught up in the important events of the Battle of Naboo. At the time he was a Padawan learner, apprenticed to Jedi Master Qui-Gon Jinn."